Cell["\<\
Function for plotting the transient steady solution of (k,l) mode at \
O(\\epsilon).
arbitrary initial conditions maybe plugged in to the general solution.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979410060087123*^9, 3.979410084958857*^9}, {
  3.979411260443377*^9, 
  3.979411339361071*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"199cf626-76c6-41b4-bd1d-\
